This product includes data from GeoNames (https://www.geonames.org/), a
populated-places dataset licensed under the Creative Commons Attribution 4.0
License (https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/). A trimmed subset (town
name, coordinates, and population) is bundled at
m110/seed/geonames/cities1000.tsv.gz and used to estimate the local light-pollution
"glow" floor for session planning. GeoNames data is provided "as is" without
warranty; see the GeoNames license for details.

---

Packaged builds of this product bundle uranometria
(https://github.com/devonjones/uranometria), Copyright Devon Jones, licensed
under the Apache License, Version 2.0. It draws the app's sky-map charts, and
ships the reference data those charts are made of:

  - OpenNGC (https://github.com/mattiaverga/OpenNGC), licensed CC-BY-SA-4.0
    (https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/): NGC, IC, Messier and
    Caldwell records.
  - Sharpless (1959) Sh2 positions, via VizieR catalogue VII/20
    (https://cdsarc.cds.unistra.fr/viz-bin/cat/VII/20).
  - d3-celestial (https://github.com/ofrohn/d3-celestial), licensed BSD-3-Clause:
    stars to magnitude 6, constellation lines and names.
  - The Marcellus and IBM Plex Mono fonts, licensed under the SIL Open Font
    License, embedded as data URIs.
